title: Colour system
tags: Design Components

The palette is defined in [[$:/palettes/Vivid]] and drives every surface through the `<<colour>>` macro.

Primary accents:

* Violet `#8b5cff` — links and primary actions
* Cyan `#22d3ee` — sidebar links and info
* Magenta `#ff49db` — hover and emphasis
* Lime `#b4f461` — success and stability

Backgrounds step from a near-black page field up through glassy translucent panels.
